          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidaah gideaba meendeawani baleanda, gayghami; aba gideaba giiseaneega jea agoonean gaygwanuusan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba soomjeandaang'u ghoaghaashta geaw aba badayda orjeeda aba heeda bwaabwa, nea geayeeshi, ‘Iimeadeelni ea gabiigu headaang'u, abeeda gaydoaw siida muy aba madeeda bwaabwa aba eaweegeasu sean.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, gaydeabiida hiji doaw soomjeanda ng'utamiideanyu aba hoorgeeda baleanda; ak ginung'waadi orjeeda gabiikta sea orjooga ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaydabeadaan heeda bwaabwa iimeadeayeewani baleanda? Ghaawali dadaah gidamuy jea gabussa bwaabwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.34"
            ]
          }
        }
